SUMMARY:Full Moon Practice: Discovering the Dwarf Planets 🌕✨
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for a special Meditation & Breath
 work session as we honor the Full Moon in Scorpio and the Dwarf Planet Hau
 mea!\n\nHaumea is a powerful symbol for New Earth--representing regenerati
 on and abundance. After tuning into the astrology of the Full Moon\, we si
 t to connect "directly" to the incredible celestial bodies of our Solar Sy
 stem and their evolution-encouraging guidance.\n\nJoin us for **FREE** on 
 Zoom.\n\n**Please email me at liminalyoga@gmail.com for Zoom link and spec
 ify "Full Moon Meditation Link."** Please arrive no later than 8:10 as we 
 will be dropping into our physical and energetic body then. If you enjoyed
  the session and want to donate\, please [go here](https://liminalyoga.com
 /payment/) for options.\n\nWant to go deeper? Integrating these energies i
 nto your body is a sure way to establish a lasting relationship with these
  celestial bodies. If you'd like to attend our online **Full Moon yoga cla
 ss** on Wednesday\, April 24 from 9-10:15am\, it's $15 to drop in. More de
 tails [here](https://liminalyoga.com/event/full-moon-practice-discovering-
 the-dwarf-planets-4/)!\n\n[Meditation & Breathwork](liminalyoga.com/medita
 tion-breathwork) sessions meet regularly M-F 8-9am ET via Zoom\, and you'r
 e welcome to join us anytime for FREE. More about themes and practices on 
 our [Events Calendar](liminalyoga.com/events).\n\n*Can't make the live ses
 sion? Or ready for more? Join our [EarthHeart Healing Community](http://ea
 rthhearthaven.com/community) to access a wide library of moon classes\, br
 ain-enhancing exercises\, and so much more!* 🌕✨
